// The workbook's types, as the contract (`logic/res/abi.json`) answers them: first generated by
// @calimero/abi-codegen from v1's ABI, kept since. The calls are the generated
// [network.calimero.sheets.generated.client.SheetsClient] (`scripts/mobile-codegen.sh` at the repo
// root); until the logic derives `AbiType` the ABI names these types without their shape, so the
// client answers their JSON and [toSheets] reads it.

